text Over at the school gate under the falling rain is the familiar baby boar.
text Is he waiting for Kyou...?
text Nah... they were together during lunch break.
text Under the falling rain, Botan looks up at my direction.
text Almost as if he knows that I am here.
text He's staring this way...
text Gradually, I come to my senses.
text At the same time, uneasiness begins to take hold of my mind.
text Didn't Kyou... leave early for the day...?
text If that's the case, she would probably have brought Botan back with her.
text There is no way she would leave Botan by himself.
text Of course, I cannot imagine Botan leaving Kyou's side either.
text Even so, Botan is right there...
text In that case... where is Kyou?
