text ...but Botan lets go of my trousers and start running outside the school gate.
text Without turning back, he dashes away on the rain-drenched ground.
text And I follow him.
text Paying no attention to the puddles and mud we step through, we keep running under the falling rain.
text Kyou is ahead of us.
