text By the time we reached our destination, my body has already been completely drenched from head to toe.
text At an empty patch of land overgrown with greenery...
text Amidst an atmosphere made even heavier by the falling rain...
text There she stands.
text As if she is waiting for someone...
text As if she is refusing to meet someone...
