text @[Tomoya]
text ...Kyou...
sound B2R.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...
text The sound of raindrops beating on the ground fills the silence...
text Trying to get closer, I take a step forward.
text A quiet, rustling noise blends into the sound of the downpour.
sound B2S.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Stay away...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound B2T.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Don't come... any closer...
sound B2U.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...Please...
text I have no choice but to stop...
text Even though the sound of the rain easily drowns out her quiet voice...
text ...For some reason, her voice resonates clearly in my head... as if it had pierced my heart.
text My drenched uniform sticks to my body, and slowly drains away any warmth.
text The rain drips down my back, causing me to shudder due to the coldness.
text I guess... Kyou is probably feeling it too...
text Even though spring has arrived, it is still May.
text And the chill is harder to bear when you are soaked...
text We have to at least get out of the rain...
text I start to walk forward once again.
text However, the moment before I am about to, Kyou starts to speak.
sound B2V.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...Why... are you here...?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound B2W.aac
text @[Kyou]
text School... hasn't ended yet, has it...?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...I saw Botan from my classroom...
text @[Tomoya]
text I heard you left early, so I thought it strange...
sound B2X.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...It's nothing... you need to worry about...
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't be absurd...
sound B2Y.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...Didn't I tell you...? You just need to think about your girlfriend... about Ryou...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound B2Z.aac
text @[Kyou]
text You don't have to... care about me at all...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Like hell I can...
