sound B31.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I'm... her sister...
sound B32.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I'm her twin sister...
sound B33.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I'm the one person that you must not care about...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound B34.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Of course... to me... you are also the one person that I must not think about...
sound B35.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I know that... but...
text She grabs her arm, as if to hold everything in...
text From how her fingers turned pale and the drops of rainwater seeping out of her clothes, I can tell how hard she is gripping...
text Seeing that, I find myself at a loss of words.
music BGM18A.mp3
sound ~
sound B36.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Seeing you two doing so well... really hurts...
text What should I say...? What should I do...?
sound B37.aac
text @[Kyou]
text It really pains me... to be around you two when you've become "lovers"...
text It feels like I'm being tied down...
sound B38.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I'm such a terrible girl... And I was the one who told you to go out with her...
text All I can do is to look at Kyou being beaten by the falling rain.
sound B39.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Ryou... told me that she kissed you...
sound B3A.aac
text @[Kyou]
text She looked so happy... when she thanked me...
sound B3B.aac
text @[Kyou]
text At first, I just smiled and listened to her, and told her that it's so nice...
sound B3C.aac
text @[Kyou]
text But when I got back to my room, my heart suddenly hurt so much... and it became incredibly painful to bear...
text Her shoulder and the hand she's gripping her arm with are trembling...
sound B3D.aac
text @[Kyou]
text The day before yesterday...
sound B3E.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...I saw the two of you at school...
text I can feel a spike of pain in my chest...
text For a moment, I forgot about the rain beating down on my body.
text My mind, my body... and my heart... everything has gone blank.
sound B3F.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Well, of course... that isn't anything strange at all...
sound B3G.aac
text @[Kyou]
text You two are going out... so that's only natural...
sound B3H.aac
text @[Kyou]
text And it's not like... that was your first time either...
text She grips her arm even tighter...
sound B3I.aac
text @[Kyou]
text But... before I knew it, I was already crying...
sound B3J.aac
text @[Kyou]
text And it wouldn't stop...
sound B3K.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I told myself that so many... so many times... and it still wouldn't stop...
sound B3L.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I can't... bear watching the two of you anymore...
sound B3M.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Even during lunch today... you two did the same stuff you were doing the day before yesterday again...
text She solemnly says, as if she is spitting out the words from the bitterness that had built up within her.
sound B3N.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Just thinking about that, I couldn't bear to stay in school anymore...
sound B3O.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...It's already too late...
sound B3P.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...for noticing how I felt... and for lying to myself...
text It's too late...
text I wonder who that actually applies to.
text I wonder if it is just Kyou...
text These past few days...
text The oddness and anxiety that I've felt when I was with Ryou...
text ...And my hesitation...
sound B3Q.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...I was scared...
sound B3R.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I was too scared to confess...
sound B3S.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I thought if I confessed and you turned me down... we wouldn't be able to talk to each other as friends anymore...
sound B3T.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...And I wouldn't be able to hang around you anymore...
sound B3U.aac
text @[Kyou]
text And so I thought... maybe I'd just keep being your friend...
sound B3V.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I thought if I did that... then nobody would be hurt...
sound B3W.aac
text @[Kyou]
text That's why I held my feelings back...
sound B3X.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...I regret it...
