sound B3Z.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Even though it's something I had decided... something that I chose to do... all I am left with is regret...
text There is a sorrowful smile on her face...
text One that betrays a feeling that she despises herself... forcibly deepening what was once a small wound.
text I feel that something important to me is starting to break.
text At first, it is a small crack...
text Then, gradually, its surface starts to crumble...
text On the other side of that surface is a pitch black darkness... like a bottomless well.
text Within it, sadness and regret stir, threatening to drown me if I fall in.
sound B40.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I am so cruel...
sound B41.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I was trying to get the two of you together...
sound B42.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I was telling Ryou that she could do it...
sound B43.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...but in reality, I didn't want it to go well...!
sound B44.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I'd hoped that you would turn her down...!
sound B45.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I was doing everything with that on my mind!
text ...That's wrong...
text Who's the cruel person here...?
text Who did I see... via Ryou...?
