text I act as though I care for others, but in reality I only think for myself...
sound B48.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Even though I didn't want myself to be hurt, I wanted others to be hurt...
sound B49.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I hate how I am like that!
text Time continues to flow...
text Even though I should have noticed, I pretended to not have noticed and continued to hurt her...
text The person who is the most cruel here is─
