text I wonder if what I am doing... deserves derision...
text It's just... rather than thinking about it...
text ...Rather than expressing it with words...
text This is the best way to express what is on my mind.
text Even if that in and of itself is betraying Ryou...
text ...If I do not do anything right now, I would only come to regret it.
text I can no longer... suppress my own feelings...
sound B4B.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Why...?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound B4C.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Do you know what... you are doing...?
text @[Tomoya]
