sound B4D.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...
text The many raindrops falling from the sky seep through our clothes and drench our body.
text My body is getting cold...
text I feel a sense of coldness every time drops of water drip down my back. It feels as if a hand made of ice is taking hold of my heart.
text But...
text I can doubtlessly feel warmth through my arms.
text Slowly, that gentle, soothing warmth displaces the cold...
text I feel a huge sense of existence and relief in my chest as it inflates and deflates to my breaths.
text Yeah... right now, we are so close to each other...
